.TH GETITIMER 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
getitimer \- read an interval timer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/time.h>
.B int getitimer(int which, struct itimerval* value);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads the timer selected by ITIMER_REAL, ITIMER_VIRTUAL or ITIMER_PROF.
The it_interval and it_value members are timeval structures.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set. Success leaves errno unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setitimer (3crunch),
.BR getitimer (2)
